      "seed": 710017867,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 910019969,
      "updated": 1790481600000,
      "text": "BEFORE\nPostgreSQL + JSONB\n\nAutomation documents and growing payloads\nincreased database volume and affected\nquery performance — even after indexes\nand optimizations.",
      "originalText": "BEFORE\nPostgreSQL + JSONB\n\nAutomation documents and growing payloads\nincreased database volume and affected\nquery performance — even after indexes\nand optimizations.",
