      "versionNonce": 910020767,
      "updated": 1790481600000,
      "text": "CORRELATION ID — END-TO-END PROPAGATION\n\nSPA / request  →  Graph  →  RabbitMQ  →  Orchestration  →  Engine  →  Camunda  →  ServiceNow  →  execution result\n\nConceptual traceability only; no distributed-tracing product is assumed.",
      "originalText": "CORRELATION ID — END-TO-END PROPAGATION\n\nSPA / request  →  Graph  →  RabbitMQ  →  Orchestration  →  Engine  →  Camunda  →  ServiceNow  →  execution result\n\nConceptual traceability only; no distributed-tracing product is assumed.",
