      "versionNonce": 910022420,
      "updated": 1790481600000,
      "text": "NARRATIVE PATH\n1  Product / IDP & personas   →   2  SPA / GraphQL   →   3  Event-driven backend   →   4  Engine / Camunda execution   →   5  Persistence evolution\n6  Resilience & idempotency   →   7  ServiceNow governance   →   8  Testing / Octane evidence   →   9  End-to-end auditability   →   10  Failure scenarios / trade-offs",
